# The build spec and the working rules are kept out of the public repo deliberately. They
# still live in the project root on a working copy — CLAUDE.md is what holds the rules in
# force for anyone (or anything) editing this code, and the source comments cite PLAN.md by
# section around 213 times. A clone will not have them, so those citations point at a
# document you have to be given rather than one you can read here. That is the accepted
# trade: the spec carries planning material that has no business on a public README.
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
FEATURE-*.md
